  "description": "A refined young heir secretly harbors an intense love for his clumsy personal secretary, refusing to fire him despite countless broken valuables and destroyed data. When an accident injures his hand, the secretary takes responsibility and becomes his hands, bringing them dangerously close. As their forced intimacy blurs the line between duty and desire, the lovestruck heir struggles to confess his feelings.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/why_youngmaster)",
